# Keep LF in the working tree on every machine. The records (HISTORY.jsonl, TASKS.md,
# QUESTIONS.jsonl) and the scripts are written with LF, and Git for Windows would
# otherwise check them out as CRLF because of the system-wide core.autocrlf=true.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.npz binary
*.onnx binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
